    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Experience the RV life with Van Life Simulator! Buy new vans to renovate, upgrade than sell or rent it! Approach this life however you like. Be a van renovator, or run a van renting company or just simply live the life of RV. Roam freely on open world and camp anywhere!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711690/extras/17817b4b4882a05404e351336df6cd02.avif?t=1725661470\" width=624 height=100 /></span><br>In Van Life Simulator, the open world is not just a setting; it's an immersive stage where every hill, valley, and cityscape beckons you to explore, promising not just a game but an odyssey. Explore endless possibilities in the captivating open world of van life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711690/extras/5a7c111e7f12bc5efb278f7c0a614e85.avif?t=1725661470\" width=624 height=100 /></span><br>Your camping choices are as vast as the open road. Pick your spot from a variety of camping locations, each offering a unique vibe and challenges. Want a peaceful lakeside retreat? Or maybe a challenging mountain spot is more your style? The choice is yours, and it goes beyond just scenery\u2014it affects your gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711690/extras/efbf9ea7f0f2177d125a91505e5cd5a2.avif?t=1725661470\" width=624 height=100 /></span><br>Choose from diverse vans, from vintage to modern, each with unique features. Customize your van with upgrades or sell it for income. Unleash your creativity by renovating and imprinting your identity on your home on wheels. Every decision shapes a unique narrative for your van life journey<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711690/extras/e12f95e45f87ac9f311dca24cc303955.avif?t=1725661470\" width=624 height=100 /></span><br>The weather isn't just for show; it affects how you experience both day and night. A clear sky might offer a perfect view of the stars, while rain or snow could add an extra layer of challenge to your journey. Adapt your strategy and make decisions based on the dynamic weather patterns, adding a layer of realism that keeps the game engaging.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711690/extras/8ee43c114fe4dc4abf170804705cf137.avif?t=1725661470\" width=624 height=100 /></span><br>Rent an RV to explore without commitment, sell or rent your existing van for income, and buy new ones to renovate and upgrade. The choices are yours to shape your unique journey.",
